msgstr "Browsers and caches keep pages for"

msgid "How long visitors' browsers and caches may show a page without asking the site. With no time they ask every time, and an unchanged page costs little. Changes show after at most this time; signed-in editors always see the latest pages."
msgstr "How long visitors' browsers and caches may show a page without asking the site. With no time they ask every time, and an unchanged page costs little. Changes show after at most this time; signed-in editors always see the latest pages."

