msgid "The site keeps pages in memory for"
msgstr "The site keeps pages in memory for"

msgid "The site keeps the pages it sends visitors in memory and sends them again without making them anew. Changes made on this server show at once, in the admin and when content is published at its planned time. Changes made by another server of the site, and what changes with time alone, such as an event that has passed, show after at most this time. Signed-in editors, and visitors who sent a form, always get a fresh page."
msgstr "The site keeps the pages it sends visitors in memory and sends them again without making them anew. Changes made on this server show at once, in the admin and when content is published at its planned time. Changes made by another server of the site, and what changes with time alone, such as an event that has passed, show after at most this time. Signed-in editors, and visitors who sent a form, always get a fresh page."

