msgstr "No, not even this site"

msgid "Content-Security-Policy"
msgstr "Content-Security-Policy"

msgid "Lets browsers run only the scripts and styles the site serves itself, which blocks most code injected into a page. Report only blocks nothing: browsers report what the policy would block, and the site writes it to its log. Check the log, then enforce. A theme with styles or scripts written into its pages needs changes first."
msgstr "Lets browsers run only the scripts and styles the site serves itself, which blocks most code injected into a page. Report only blocks nothing: browsers report what the policy would block, and the site writes it to its log. Check the log, then enforce. A theme with styles or scripts written into its pages needs changes first."

msgid "Report only, block nothing"
msgstr "Report only, block nothing"

msgid "Enforce"
msgstr "Enforce"

msgid "Outside sources"
msgstr "Outside sources"

msgid "Other sites the pages may load from, one directive per line followed by addresses, such as frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com for embedded videos. Directives: img-src, media-src, font-src, style-src, script-src, connect-src, frame-src, worker-src, manifest-src and form-action. The site's own files and its media storage are always allowed."
msgstr "Other sites the pages may load from, one directive per line followed by addresses, such as frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com for embedded videos. Directives: img-src, media-src, font-src, style-src, script-src, connect-src, frame-src, worker-src, manifest-src and form-action. The site's own files and its media storage are always allowed."

msgid "Each line needs a directive, such as frame-src, and addresses, such as https://www.youtube-nocookie.com. Inline code, eval and every site (*) cannot be allowed."
msgstr "Each line needs a directive, such as frame-src, and addresses, such as https://www.youtube-nocookie.com. Inline code, eval and every site (*) cannot be allowed."

